        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jimmy Hoffa, Danny DeVito, David Mamet, Jack Nicholson, John Joseph Nicholson, Karen Black, Susan Anspach, Ralph Waite, Sally Struthers\n- Films: Hoffa, Five Easy Pieces\n- Organizations: Teamsters\n- Roles: Robert Ciaro\n\nFacts:\n- Jack Nicholson was born as John Joseph Nicholson on April 22, 1937.\n- Jack Nicholson is an American actor and filmmaker who has performed for over 60 years.\n- Hoffa is a 1992 French-American biographical crime film.\n- Danny DeVito directed Hoffa, and David Mamet wrote Hoffa.\n- Hoffa is based on the life of Teamsters leader Jimmy Hoffa.\n- Jack Nicholson plays Jimmy Hoffa in Hoffa.\n- Danny DeVito plays Robert Ciaro in Hoffa.\n- Robert Ciaro is an amalgamation of several Jimmy Hoffa associates over the years.\n- Five Easy Pieces stars Jack Nicholson.\n- Karen Black, Susan Anspach, Ralph Waite, and Sally Struthers have supporting roles in Five Easy Pieces.",
